  "Application": "EESimulator",
  "Title": "Voltage-Controlled Oscillator (VCO)",
  "Description": "Precision dual op-amp voltage-controlled oscillator (VCO) where a DC control voltage (1V to 5V) directly sets the charging slope of an active Miller integrator (LM741, C = 100 nF), coupled to a hysteresis Schmitt trigger comparator (LM741) in a self-oscillating loop delivering linear triangle and square wave outputs.",
